CORE
followed-by4.sv
--bound 1
^\[main\.p1\] always \(main\.x == 0 #-# 1\): REFUTED$
^\[main\.p2\] \(1 or \(##2 1\)\) #-# main\.x == 2: PROVED up to bound 1$
^\[main\.p3\] \(1 or \(##2 1\)\) #-# main\.x == 0: PROVED up to bound 1$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The match of the LHS of p2 at time 2 is beyond the bound; the property
must not be refuted.
